  "notes": "This is a Master Franchise (Subfranchisor) FDD for Vanguard Cleaning Systems, Inc., filed in Minnesota, dated 4/2026. Table 1 is labeled 'Systemwide Subfranchisor Summary' and tracks subfranchisors (Area Franchisors / Master Franchisees), not individual unit franchisees. Table 3 is labeled 'Status of Subfranchisors' \u2014 rows represent subfranchisor agreements by state, not individual unit outlets. The franchisor does not grant franchises for commercial cleaning businesses directly; affiliates RR Franchising Inc., KY Franchising, and IN Franchising operate as company-owned subfranchisor outlets (Table 4). OR 2023 note: 1 reacquired by franchisor but outlets_end=1 (footnote indicates adjustment for Canadian/satellite offices). VA 2023: 2 outlets at start, 1 ceased operations for other reasons, 1 at end (footnote: two development areas purchased by shareholders of two other subfranchisors and combined into single development area). Total row in Table 3 shows 48 outlets start and end for all three years \u2014 this reflects adjustments eliminating Canadian subfranchisors and satellite offices, and differs from Table 1 franchised end counts (48, 48, 45) because Table 1 tracks agreements in effect at year-end while Table 3 totals reflect adjusted subfranchisor counts. Table No. 4 title states 'Fiscal Years of 2022, 2023 and 2024' but data rows are actually for 2023, 2024, and 2025 \u2014 apparent title error in the source document."
